    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10476" root="خرو" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُرَةُ الفَأْسِ</span></b> , as in the Tekmileh, on the authority
of Fr; in the K and accord. to Sgh, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الفَأْسِ</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُرْوَةُ</span></b> ,
which is a mistake; (TA;) <i>The</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُرْت</span> [q. v. in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خرت</span>] <i>of the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فأس</span>: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُرَاتٌ</span>; (Fr, Sgh, K,
TA;) like as <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُبَةٌ</span> has for its pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثُبَاتٌ</span>. (TA.)

